WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.452
- So former general Mike
Flynn is back in the news.

00:00:02.452 --> 00:00:04.940
(groaning) Man!

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:09.070
Yeah, so Flynn is back in the
news for apparently advocating

00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:12.410
for a Myanmar-style military
coup in the United States.

00:00:12.410 --> 00:00:14.180
Remember, you may not like this speech,

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:15.540
but this is almost certainly protected

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:16.373
by the First Amendment.

00:00:16.373 --> 00:00:17.710
As laid out in the Brandenburg case,

00:00:17.710 --> 00:00:19.480
if you're talking about incitement,

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:22.170
that means that this kind
of speech has to be intended

00:00:22.170 --> 00:00:24.600
and likely to produce
imminent lawless action,

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:26.260
and that's just not the case here.

00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:27.580
Flynn is a crazy person

00:00:27.580 --> 00:00:29.320
talking to a bunch of other crazy people,

00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:31.953
we're not going to see
him in court anytime soon.

